Subject: [PATCH 5/6] M2-C2b4 b4-3 debug (env-gated): isolate mm to own cgraph
 (still NaN@2348 -> not multi-node-graph); dump infra for cur/w3d/vmm. KEY
 FINDING: gate_up mm cur (norm reshaped [2816,1,129]) is all-QNaN in BOTH
 arena and v1 exec_mm_vk paths - contradicts v1 vulkan mm being correct; v1's
 'all-vram vulkan mm == baseline' may have been a CPU-path artifact
 (exec_mm_vk fires 60x but cur is NaN). Next: re-verify whether v1 vulkan mm
 ever really ran correct on device, and why norm->data is QNaN (norm
 privatization/binding/order). RAM IDENTICAL.

